msgid "Let Skins Change Settings"
msgstr "スキンによる設定変更を許可する"

#: src/App/Neomod/OptionsOverlay.cpp
msgid ""
"Skins can come with settings of their own ([neomod] section in skin.ini).\n"
"While such a skin is in use, those settings can't be changed here."
msgstr ""
"スキンは独自の設定を持つことがあります（skin.iniの[neomod]セクション）。\n"
